#   status planned (nothing packed) | data-ready (the files exist, no pack builder yet) | installable (pack + manifest + installer verified) -- NOTHING is installable yet
# An owned item shows in the Store as <user>:x<qty> from the user's owned.pdl (build step b). Deny-list for every pack: provider keys, .env, private keys, wallets without sensitive=1.
